WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.840
Meet Theresa.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.400
She's a CIO at a major insurance provider

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.760
and she's feeling stressed.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.880
Her board wants her to
improve customer NPS,

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.960
reduce loss adjustment expenses,

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.840
and speed market responsiveness.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.560
That's not possible

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.920
with her current claims processing system.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.360
It's complex, it's manual, and it's slow.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.520
She needs a resilient, scalable way

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.280
to react nimbly to market
demands and delight customers.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.520
In other words, she
needs a modern approach

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.040
to transform her operations.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.240
Her solution?

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.520
IBM Cloud Paks.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.160
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.360
The AI-powered hybrid cloud software

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.520
is built on Red Hat OpenShift

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.000
and managed through one
intelligent control plane.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.400
So it's quick and easy for Theresa

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.200
to start building, modernizing,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.000
and managing applications

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.680
securely across any cloud with confidence.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.240
Because IBM Cloud Paks are pre-certified

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:57.400
and pre-integrated,

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.880
Theresa can empower the
team she already has.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.080
With the power of AI,

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.240
she can automate insurance claims,

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.960
improve the customer authorization

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.080
and claim process experience,

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.400
and reduce the cost of operations

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.000
all with no disruption,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.960
no manual processes across the enterprise.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.120
The result?

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.600
A happy board,

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:19.800
happy customers,

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.280
and a stress free Theresa.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:24.000
Reinvent how you work,

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.160
and re-imagine the future
with IBM Cloud Paks.

